"* Removed add-on version from \"Braille Essentials\" NVDA menu item.\n"
"* Changed add-on homepage and source URL.\n"
"* Removed add-on update check feature and update channel options (add-on "
"updates done through the add-on store).\n"
"* Remove \"website\" menu item (add-on website can be opened from add-on "
"store).\n"
"* Remove \"translation pot file\" menu item (no replacement)."
